From 4fb6b5b08ad35a954d60102f1d0ba113c3eedb99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Apile Tyumre <apile@asantesolutions.co.za>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:32:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Apply changes made by Asante

Asante's changes to files copied from frappe/lms. This is the only
commit in the sync that edits upstream-derived files; it is exported
as patches/0001-Apply-changes-made-by-Asante.patch. See SYNCING.md for
why each change exists.

- Build and asset paths point at lms_extension (package.json,
  vite.config.js, vite.signup-select.config.js, signup-form.html)
- Courses: students open on Enrolled; instructors only see courses
  they teach; staff get Live/New/Upcoming/Created/Unpublished tabs
- Sidebar: Student Portal link

Dropped from the previous patch because upstream now covers them:
- Assignment due date (custom_due_date): replaced by upstream's
  assignment scheduling
- MobileLayout fallback for non-route links: the new phone shell lists
  them on the You page and handles external links itself

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
